    <statement><p>Find the partial derivative indicated.
Assume the variables are restricted to a domain on
which the function is defined.
<me>z = \frac{5x^{2}y^{5}-y^{5}}{12xy-8}.</me> 
<m>z_y =</m> <fillin characters="65" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{\left(5x^{2}\cdot 5y^{4}-5y^{4}\right)\mathopen{}\left(12xy-8\right)-\left(5x^{2}y^{5}-y^{5}\right)\cdot 12x}{\left(12xy-8\right)^{2}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>z_y = \frac{\left(5x^{2}\cdot 5y^{4}-5y^{4}\right)\mathopen{}\left(12xy-8\right)-\left(5x^{2}y^{5}-y^{5}\right)\cdot 12x}{\left(12xy-8\right)^{2}}.</me>



</solution>
